{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/Steam_Top_of_Page.png?t=1743372114\" />Embark on a strategic journey in <i>Starcade FACTIONS</i> \u2014where every move could be your path to victory or defeat! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/Gameplay_Middle_Banner.png?t=1743372114\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every turn offers up to three powerful actions:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build new ships for your fleet...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/BuildShipsGIF.gif?t=1743372114\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play a powerful Action card...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/BossActionCardGIF.gif?t=1743372114\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move ships and launch attacks...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/MovingShipsGIF.gif?t=1743372114\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission is clear: capture the enemy\u2019s Flagship and claim your victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/VictoryGIF.gif?t=1743372114\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/Simple_to_Play_Middle_Banner.png?t=1743372114\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this fast-paced, turn-based strategy game, you're not just a commander; you're the mastermind behind epic space battles. Engage in quick, action-packed games that last just about 5 minutes, perfect for when you need a quick burst of high-octane action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/Strategic_to_Master_Middle_Banner.png?t=1743372114\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With 10 unique ship types like Fighters, Medics, and Builders, you\u2019ll uncover layers of strategy that are easy to grasp but challenging to master. The simplicity of the controls means anyone can jump in, but only the best can truly dominate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/Steam_Bottom_of_Page.png?t=1743372114\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>As a passion project from a solo developer, Starcade FACTIONS is brimming with potential. Your support can help it reach new heights\u2014download it for free and join the growing community today!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2389480?t=1743372114","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/803dc7f8eff5481858b5a6ff0a2ff266ff0bd456/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743372114","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/29eb6eebb6101d0e2bff16522da5e9a6f1b8db67/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743372114","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/29eb6eebb6101d0e2bff16522da5e9a6f1b8db67/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743372114","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/Steam_Top_of_Page.png?t=1743372114\" />Embark on a strategic journey in <i>Starcade FACTIONS</i> \u2014where every move could be your path to victory or defeat! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/Gameplay_Middle_Banner.png?t=1743372114\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every turn offers up to three powerful actions:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build new ships for your fleet...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/BuildShipsGIF.gif?t=1743372114\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play a powerful Action card...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/BossActionCardGIF.gif?t=1743372114\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move ships and launch attacks...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/MovingShipsGIF.gif?t=1743372114\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission is clear: capture the enemy\u2019s Flagship and claim your victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/VictoryGIF.gif?t=1743372114\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/Simple_to_Play_Middle_Banner.png?t=1743372114\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this fast-paced, turn-based strategy game, you're not just a commander; you're the mastermind behind epic space battles. Engage in quick, action-packed games that last just about 5 minutes, perfect for when you need a quick burst of high-octane action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/Strategic_to_Master_Middle_Banner.png?t=1743372114\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With 10 unique ship types like Fighters, Medics, and Builders, you\u2019ll uncover layers of strategy that are easy to grasp but challenging to master. The simplicity of the controls means anyone can jump in, but only the best can truly dominate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/Steam_Bottom_of_Page.png?t=1743372114\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>As a passion project from a solo developer, Starcade FACTIONS is brimming with potential. Your support can help it reach new heights\u2014download it for free and join the growing community today!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Alexander Clark"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Microsoft Playfab ","genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/3e045ea5787f8b3c2c7092357ed950d13b2d35cb/header.jpg?t=1743372114","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 \u2117 2024 Starcade Arcade LLC","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257084607,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257084607/movie480.mp4?t=1735057913","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257084607/movie_max.